# Welbuk brand files

Supplied by the user in chat on 2026-11-12 as the official Welbuk logo (W mark, "Welbuk" wordmark, TM).

| File | What | Source |
|---|---|---|
| welbuk-logo-pink-on-white.png | Pink logo on white, 500x500 RGB | user-supplied, unchanged |
| welbuk-logo-white-on-pink.png | White logo on pink, 500x500 RGB | user-supplied, unchanged |
| welbuk-logo-pink-transparent.png | Pink logo on a transparent background, 500x500 RGBA | derived from the pink-on-white file: alpha from distance to white (green channel), colour set to the measured pink |

Measured brand pink in the supplied files: rgb(253, 0, 106) = #FD006A. The 24-page storyboard (v3.0) specifies #FF0066; the two differ slightly.

These logos are composited onto final pages; they are never redrawn by an image model. 500 px is enough for small placements (page footer, labels); a vector (SVG) or larger file is needed for a large final-page logo.
